<title>USA: Albemarle Q4 shr $0.32 vs $0.43.</title>
<headline>Albemarle Q4 shr $0.32 vs $0.43.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter Ended December 31</p>
<p>					   1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net sales			  $204,495  $296,049</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold		137,011   224,577</p>
<p>     Gross profit		   67,484    71,472</p>
<p>Selling, R&amp;D and general</p>
<p> expenses			     38,949    40,311</p>
<p>    Operating profit		28,535    31,161</p>
<p>Interest and financing</p>
<p>   expenses				162     3,054</p>
<p> Gain on sale of businesses(a)	--  (18,502)</p>
<p> Other income, net		   (202)   (2,535)</p>
<p> Income before income taxes     28,575    49,144</p>
<p> Income taxes			 10,662    20,210</p>
<p> Net income			   17,913    28,934</p>
<p> Earnings per share		    .32	 .43</p>
<p>Shares used to compute</p>
<p>  earnings per share		55,406(b) 66,599</p>
<p>					Year Ended Dec 31</p>
<p>					1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net sales			$854,481  $1,244,222</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold	    611,353     967,204</p>
<p>   Gross profit		  243,128     277,018</p>
<p>Selling, R&amp;D and general</p>
<p>  expenses			 149,702     160,055</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    93,426     116,963</p>
<p>Interest and financing</p>
<p>  expenses			   2,529	13,265</p>
<p>Gain on sales of</p>
<p>  businesses (a)	     (158,157)    (23,427)</p>
<p> Other income, net	     (4,025)     (4,468)</p>
<p> Income before income taxes  253,079     131,593</p>
<p> Income taxes		     97,020	53,363</p>
<p> Net income			156,059	78,230</p>
<p> Earnings per share		 2.65	  1.18</p>
<p>Shares used to compute</p>
<p>  earnings per share	 58,842(b)	66,352</p>
<p>Notes:  </p>
<p>(a) 1996 amount includes gain resulting from the March 1, 1996 sale of the alpha olefins, poly alpha olefins, and synthetic alcohols businesses to Amoco Chemical Company, net of certain costs incurred in connection with the sale, for $500 million, including plant and equipment, other assets, inventory and accounts receivable net of related trade payables ($94.4 million after income taxes, or $1.60 per share).  </p>
<p>Fourth quarter 1995 includes gain from the prepayment of a long term note associated with the sale of the Company's electronic materials business ($11.4 million after income taxes, or 17 cents per share).  1995 amount includes the total gain on the sale of the Company's electronic materials business ($14.5 million, or 22 cents per share).</p>
<p>(b) Includes the effects of the purchase of 9,484,465 common shares through a tender offer concluded on April 1, 1996 and additional second and third quarter purchases of 275,400 and 1,481,000 common shares, respectively.</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Albemarle Corp.</p>
